41|agent-squad|Optional SupervisorAgent actively mediates information among otherwise unaware specialists and chooses necessary contacts, exposing composable S2 without a persistent S3 control ledger.
42|mastra|The optional supervisor/network path regulates current primitive selection as composable S3, while task-completion scorers can independently block completion and feed corrective feedback into further iterations as composable S3*.
43|beeai-framework|Main-agent HandoffTool specialists and RequirementAgent constraints remain operational delegation/policy support; no separate S2-S5 organizational function is established.
