45|superagentx|Autonomous workflows include retries, persistence, audit data, and a human-approval governance agent, but governance remains parent-controlled rather than S5.
46|browser-use|A standard browser agent independently turns a task into browser actions until completion, with no separate organizational layer evidenced.
47|roo-code|Specialized Code, Architect, Ask, Debug, and custom modes alter one coding-agent role; mode specialization is not a multi-S1 organization.
