50|langgraph-bigtool|Semantic retrieval attenuates a very large tool catalog before action, making tool-selection variety management the distinctive mechanism inside one S1.
51|openmanus|The stable distribution is a general-purpose single-agent path; its documented multi-agent flow is explicitly unstable and therefore excluded from OOB metasystem claims.
52|kilo-code|Default-on background subagents and Kilo Swarm close agent-owned S2 over overlap and blocker coordination; Agent Manager exposes composable S3 with a distinct human parent-control mode, while /review exposes composable S3* through dedicated review subagents.
