110|ag2|AG2's model/tool Agent loop owns autonomous S1, while the built-in multi-party discussion protocol provides constructor-owned S2 through enforced round-robin turn regulation; Hub governance, audit, knowledge and HITL do not establish S3, S3*, S4 or S5 closure.
